      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Back in the day, when it was a dream",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Nobody believed in what I could be",
          "rhyme":"ab",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"But now I'm laughin' at 'em like, \"Ha-ha-ha\"",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"'Cause I'ma be okay",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
