    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I used to have a dream, now it seem that I'ma live it in real life",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Gettin' free jeans, good weed, feelin' real nice",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Used to think that I was too short or too dumb",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Just a newcomer to the game tryna do somethin'",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Used to runnin' after ice cream trucks",
          "rhyme":"yk",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"But now I just stroll, lacе my Nikes up",
          "rhyme":"9p",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I'm a nice, clean cut, good lookin' individual",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Fillin' up a notebook with rhymes when I be in the school",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Learn quick that nobody here invincible",
          "rhyme":"ibl",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"We feel big, but in reality, we minuscule",
          "rhyme":"yl",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Try and make a million bucks before I reach my pinnacle",
          "rhyme":"akl",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Supernova status from basically invisible",
          "rhyme":"ibl",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Growin' up thinkin' it was cool to be a criminal",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Until I saw a couple homies go down",
          "rhyme":"awn",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"See, now that isn't me or anything I'm finna be",
          "rhyme":"ab",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"I want the money, cars, hoes, clothes, a kid can dream",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"I used to talk to girls that wasn't even into me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"Now they hit me up wantin' intimacy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"But nah, I got a girl and she down for me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"My little Juliet chillin' on the balcony",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"If I need it, she gon' run a hundred miles for me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"Love me for me, not who I'm 'bout to be",
          "rhyme":"ab",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"And if they didn't believe, then I can do without 'em",
          "rhyme":"Em",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"'Cause at the end of the day I'm just Malcolm",
          "rhyme":"ilm",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEFGHIJKIGLMNOPOPOMQR",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCBDEAFBDABAAABGBGBGAHB"
