    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Just a little snotty nose tryna find his pot of gold",
          "rhyme":"Old",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Stayin' up late on the phone, always callin' hoes",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Never thought I'd blow, no one took me serious",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Now they see me walkin' down the street like, \"Oh, there he is\"",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"As a kid, anything was possible",
          "rhyme":"ibl",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"But mama knows the hottest flow don't put me on the honor roll",
          "rhyme":"Ol",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Grades started slippin', the classes I be skippin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Tried to tell me that I was a fool, I wouldn't listen, no",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"As a youngin' I was playin' pretend",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"My wonder years, never woulda thought they could end",
          "rhyme":"End",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Back, back in my glory days, way before the haze",
          "rhyme":"az",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"A good night sleep had me energized for the day",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"When I would look up at the planets in they orbit",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Before this life got distorted",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Before the money was a plan",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Before I ever thought that I would need to be a man",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"Somethin' like a Peter Pan, nah, I ain't tryna grow up",
          "rhyme":"9p",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"'Cause bein' old sucks, I just wanna go nuts",
          "rhyme":"9ts",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"Before I drank a beer or ever took a hit of weed",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"When entertainment was my mom's readin' mysteries",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"Takin' you back to them nursery rhymes",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"When I thought the world just deserved to be mine",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"Said I'm takin' you back to them nursery rhymes",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"Back to the beginning, put the verse in rewind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
